### ===================== NOTIFICACIONES =====================

### OBTENER TODAS LAS NOTIFICACIONES (ADMIN o usuario actual)
GET http://localhost:3300/api/v1/notifications
Authorization: Bearer COLOCA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN

### OBTENER NOTIFICACIONES DEL USUARIO ACTUAL
GET http://localhost:3300/api/v1/notifications/my/notifications
Authorization: Bearer COLOCA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN

### CONTADOR DE NOTIFICACIONES NO LEÍDAS
GET http://localhost:3300/api/v1/notifications/my/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer COLOCA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN

### ESTADÍSTICAS DE NOTIFICACIONES
GET http://localhost:3300/api/v1/notifications/stats
Authorization: Bearer COLOCA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN

### CREAR NOTIFICACIÓN (ADMIN)
POST http://localhost:3300/api/v1/notifications
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer COLOCA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
    "idUser": 2,
    "titulo": "Nueva notificación",
    "mensaje": "Tienes una nueva alerta",
    "tipo": "info"
}

### MARCAR TODAS COMO LEÍDAS
PUT http://localhost:3300/api/v1/notifications/mark-all-read
Authorization: Bearer COLOCA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN

### OBTENER NOTIFICACIÓN POR ID
GET http://localhost:3300/api/v1/notifications/1
Authorization: Bearer COLOCA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN

### MARCAR UNA NOTIFICACIÓN COMO LEÍDA
PUT http://localhost:3300/api/v1/notifications/1/mark-read
Authorization: Bearer COLOCA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN

### ACTUALIZAR NOTIFICACIÓN
PUT http://localhost:3300/api/v1/notifications/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer COLOCA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
    "titulo": "Actualización de notificación",
    "mensaje": "Contenido actualizado"
}

### ELIMINAR NOTIFICACIÓN
DELETE http://localhost:3300/api/v1/notifications/1
Authorization: Bearer COLOCA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN

### LIMPIAR NOTIFICACIONES ANTIGUAS (ADMIN)
DELETE http://localhost:3300/api/v1/notifications/cleanup/old-notifications?days=90
Authorization: Bearer COLOCA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN

### ===================== TOKENS DE NOTIFICACIONES =====================

### OBTENER TODOS LOS TOKENS (ADMIN)
GET http://localhost:3300/api/v1/notifications/tokens/all
Authorization: Bearer COLOCA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN

### OBTENER TOKENS DEL USUARIO ACTUAL
GET http://localhost:3300/api/v1/notifications/tokens/my-tokens
Authorization: Bearer COLOCA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN

### ESTADÍSTICAS DE TOKENS (ADMIN)
GET http://localhost:3300/api/v1/notifications/tokens/stats
Authorization: Bearer COLOCA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN

### REGISTRAR UN NUEVO TOKEN
POST http://localhost:3300/api/v1/notifications/tokens/register
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer COLOCA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
    "token": "fcm_device_token_123",
    "plataforma": "android"
}

### DESACTIVAR UN TOKEN
PUT http://localhost:3300/api/v1/notifications/tokens/fcm_device_token_123/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer COLOCA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN

### OBTENER TOKEN POR ID
GET http://localhost:3300/api/v1/notifications/tokens/1
Authorization: Bearer COLOCA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN

### ACTUALIZAR TOKEN
PUT http://localhost:3300/api/v1/notifications/tokens/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer COLOCA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
    "activo": false
}

### ELIMINAR TOKEN
DELETE http://localhost:3300/api/v1/notifications/tokens/1
Authorization: Bearer COLOCA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN

### LIMPIAR TOKENS EXPIRADOS (ADMIN)
DELETE http://localhost:3300/api/v1/notifications/tokens/cleanup/expired
Authorization: Bearer COLOCA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN

### ===================== PUSH NOTIFICATIONS =====================

### ENVIAR PUSH DE PRUEBA AL USUARIO ACTUAL
POST http://localhost:3300/api/v1/notifications/push/test
Authorization: Bearer COLOCA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN

### ENVIAR PUSH PERSONALIZADO (ADMIN)
POST http://localhost:3300/api/v1/notifications/push/send/2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer COLOCA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
    "titulo": "Alerta Personalizada",
    "mensaje": "Este es un mensaje de prueba",
    "datosAdicionales": {"tipo": "alerta"}
}

### ENVIAR PUSH MASIVO (ADMIN)
POST http://localhost:3300/api/v1/notifications/push/broadcast
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer COLOCA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
    "userIds": [2, 3, 4],
    "notificacion": {
        "titulo": "Notificación Masiva",
        "mensaje": "Mensaje para múltiples usuarios",
        "datosAdicionales": {"tipo": "broadcast"}
    }
}
